<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31323" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσδέχομαι</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσδέκ-</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>take into, admit,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὸ ἱρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.144
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				206
			</span></i> : c. acc. pers., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				238
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ. φρουράν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.43.22
				</span></i>
			 : c. acc. loc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ εἰσεδέξατ᾽ οἶκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					876
				</span></i>
			: c. dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντροις εἰ. τινά</span>
			<i>receive</i> him <i>in</i> the cave, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				35
			</span></i> : rarely c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόνδ᾽ εἰσεδέξω
				τειχέων,</span>=<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τειχέων εἴσω
				ἐδέξω</span> (cf. Sch. ad loc.), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				451
			</span></i>: c. acc. dupl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσδέξασθαί τινα
				συνοικιστῆρα</span>
			<i>admit</i> him as a fellow-colonist, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				186
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ. τινά ὑπόστεγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					376
				</span></i>
			: aor. I <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσδεχθῆναι</span> in pass. sense, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tox.</u>
				30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Merc.Cond.</u>
				10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc. rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκῆψιν ἁγὼν οὗτος οὐκ ἐσδέξεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					392
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ. εὐνομίαν διὰ τῆς μουσικῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					425a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of certain
			animals, <i>take in</i> their young after birth, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				566b17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				754a29
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
